{
  "type": "74hc165",
  "name": "74HC165 8-bit parallel-in shift register",
  "category": "Logic chips (DIP)",
  "prefix": "U",
  "description": "Parallel-in, serial-out shift register (DIP-16): PL low loads D0-D7; with PL high each rising edge of CP while CE is low shifts toward Q7 and takes DS into the first stage; reads switches into a microcontroller's SPI; runs as a digital chip: with a board or on its own, inputs from the rest of the circuit arrive up to 0.1 ms late (clocks up to a few kHz)",
